Package: sable-base
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash, coreutils, systemd, fastfetch
Description: Core configuration and CLI utilities for Sable Linux
 This package contains the central distribution definitions, system
 identity namespace (/etc/sable/), MOTD, and official CLI utilities:
 sable-info, sable-update, and sable-config.
